LEXICON Adpositions ! main class
!Preposition ; !only prepositions -- check to see if this is a valid category!
Postpositions ;
PrePostpositions ;

LEXICON Postpositions
autelen PostP "before" ;
auteli PostP "in front of" ;
autelt PostP "before" ;
autest PostP "for; for the sake of" ;
auti PostP "in front of" ;
faron PostP "with; in the company of" ;
kaskan PostP "among; between" ;
kasken PostP "among; between" ;
kuoren PostP "beside" ;
kåik PostP "to; in direction to" ;
ludne PostP "at; at somseone's place, with someone" ;
lute PostP "from; from someone's place, from the company of someone" ;
melt PostP "according to" ;
mete PostP "according to" ;
nal PostP "on" ;
nalne PostP "on" ;
nalte PostP "from; from the top of" ;
palden PostP "beside" ;
pajel PostP "over" ;
pajlet PostP "from; from the upper side" ;
!rajai PostP "?" ; !maybe more of a noun in the ill.
sisa PostP "into" ;
sisne PostP "in" ;
siste PostP "out of; out from" ;
sisnjelen PostP "inside" ;
sisnjeli PostP "into; to the inside of" ;
tet PostP "for; for the sake of" ;
ulkolen PostP "outside of" ;
ulkoli PostP "to the outside of" ;
wuolen PostP "under" ;
wuollai PostP "under; (in direction) in under " ;
wuost PostP "against" ;
wuoste PostP "against" ;

LEXICON PrePostpositions
pira PrePost "around" ;
paldelen PrePost "except; without; in addition to" ;


! PoS tags added below:

!only postpositions
LEXICON PostP   !!= * **@CODE@**  adds the tag +Po
+Po: # ;

!only prepositions -- check to see if this is a valid category!
!LEXICON PreP   !!= * __@CODE@__  adds the tag +Pr
!+Pr: # ;

!both pre- and postpositions
LEXICON PrePost   !!= * **@CODE@**  adds the tags +Po and +Pr
+Po: # ;
+Pr: # ;



! 
!Även pro. för. Maite mon kalkab waddet tunji tann autest? quid tibi pro isto dabo? vad skall jag ge dig för det? Auti, coram, inför. Cum suffixo auteses, coram se, inför sig. Påte mo auti, veni coram me. Autesne, coram, inför. Autesnan, coram me, inför mig. Autaseme, coram nobis, inför oss. Härav:  " ;
!Även ante, förr, innan. Autelen quokson, ante lucem, före dagningen. Autelest, ab anteriore parte, på främre sidan. Autelesi, ante præter, præ, framför, framom. Autelesi wuejet, prætervehi, köra framför. " ;
!mangeb  comparat. posterior, den senare. Mangeben peiwen, postero die, den följande dagen. Positivus est manga, vel potius mange. 
!mangelt  mangelest, adv "& præp. a tergo, pone, bakom, bakefter. Mangelt sodn tjowo, a tergo insequitur, han följer bakefter. Autelt ja mangelt, ante & pone, förut och efteråt. Mangelt tjowot, eminus sequi, efterfölja. Studdost mangelt  tjowoi, eminus sequebatur. Mangelt wadset, eminus eundo sequi, följa efter ett stycke gåendes. Mangelt påteje, posteri, efterkommande. Mangelt jåkset, assequi. Kalle so mangelt jåksab wadsetin, eundo illum certo assequor. Äska leste mangelt jåksi, ero tandem advenit, sive assecutus est. Mangelt påtet, subsequi, komma efter. Obs. præpositio plerumque in constructione postponitur, ut: påti mo mangelt, veniebat post me. Obs. Mangelen, mangen, mangelt, nonnisi casus sunt unius vocis manga, ne autem Lector, lingvæ minus peritus, grammaticabilus hisce implicetur tricis, seorsim illos expressimus. " ;
